;; valueless-assignment.art — binding the result of an expression that
;; produces no value exits 1 silently.
;;
;; No block, no `do`, and no function nesting is required. Two statements
;; are enough.
;;
;; Run: arturo bugs/valueless-assignment.art
;; Expected: four lines, ending with "never reached".
;; Actual: three lines, then silent exit 1.

x: 1 + 1
print ["control, binds a value that exists:" x]

print "before"
y: print "hi"
print "never reached"
